00:44:06.110 --> 00:44:07.111
We don't let her out.

00:44:08.890 --> 00:44:11.490
No, she likes to get weekends
by herself sometimes.

00:44:11.490 --> 00:44:13.330
And so that's what happens.

00:44:13.330 --> 00:44:16.210
And then I will show those pictures.

00:44:16.210 --> 00:44:18.280
And then I'll pick the
best ones and be like,

00:44:18.280 --> 00:44:20.200
oh this I'll do a little photo set.

00:44:20.200 --> 00:44:21.420
And I haven't done that very often.

00:44:21.420 --> 00:44:23.890
I just did it with Joshua
Tree specifically last year.

00:44:23.890 --> 00:44:25.210
When we were in Thailand,

00:44:25.210 --> 00:44:27.620
