00:44:56.160 --> 00:44:58.480
Like send back home to
the extended family.

00:44:58.480 --> 00:45:00.490
You know these are the trips

00:45:00.490 --> 00:45:02.550
that lead to the fridge magnets.

00:45:02.550 --> 00:45:05.720
And they're also the pictures
that lead to the next trip.

00:45:05.720 --> 00:45:06.560
Right.
Right,

00:45:06.560 --> 00:45:10.140
'cause if you wanna,
you know interestingly,

00:45:10.140 --> 00:45:11.630
Jessie recently did somethin',

00:45:11.630 --> 00:45:13.630
But it's gotta be a good picture.

00:45:13.630 --> 00:45:14.980
Jessie's good.

00:45:14.980 --> 00:45:17.207
She's good at taking pictures.

00:45:17.207 --> 00:45:18.763
And she just uses her phone.

00:45:20.601 --> 00:45:23.250
And then a little bit of
whatever the editing stuff is.

00:45:23.250 --> 00:45:27.190
And then she took, she went
through a bunch of her pictures

00:45:27.190 --> 00:45:31.370
and then printed out several of them

00:45:31.370 --> 00:45:35.090
and put them in our, the
bathroom that we redid.

00:45:35.090 --> 00:45:36.170
And so like on the shelf

